OL,3,GNEWSASchool blaze caused by sun on
OL,4,Aperspex canopy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which badly damaged a school was
OL,7,Fcaused by refracted light on a perspex
OL,8,Fcanopy.
OL,10,FThe blaze damaged three classrooms at
OL,11,FThomas Bullock Primary Academy in
OL,12,FShipdham, near Dereham, Norfolk, when
OL,13,Fit broke out shortly after 14:00 BST
OL,14,Flast Thursday.
OL,16,FOliver Burwood, chief executive officer
OL,17,Fof the Diocese of Norwich Education and
OL,18,FAcademies Trust, said a perspex canopy
OL,19,Fat the front of the school had caught
OL,20,Flight and the fire had spread to the
OL,21,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
