OL,3,GNEWSASchool blaze caused by sun on
OL,4,Aperspex canopy
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the damage meant the school
OL,7,Fcould not reopen as planned on 3
OL,8,FSeptember, and remote learning would
OL,9,Ftake place for at least a week.
